# Omni with the dense prefix on FlashAttention-4 in E4M3 (Q/K static per-layer scales, V one scale per head) instead of
# BF16; the selected video tiles stay on the pair kernel (E4M3 PV).
# Measured 2026-11-07, production compose, warmup on, 6 clips: 20.44 s (old default) / 18.55 s (new default, BF16
# dense prefix) -> 15.28 s per clip; teacher-forced error vs BF16 Omni 0.2187 / 0.1121 (new default) -> 0.2249 / 0.1179 (video / audio).
#   docker compose --env-file profiles/omni-fast.env up -d omni
OMNI_DENSE_PREFIX=fp8
